The balls `‖X i − x i‖_r ≤ E i` of all variables of the high-resolution pipeline, on every strip
`r ≥ 0` with `e^r ≤ 74315/2^16`,
built variable by variable (`ballH_k`, `chain_succ`) from the kernel checks of
`Design/RationalStellaratorGCTorusCheckH*` (`node_full`), the node identities of
`Design/RationalStellaratorGCTorusRelH` and the node step `vstep`. Generated by
`scripts/gc_kam/emit_lean.py`.
-/

